# The offer pages are hashed byte for byte for their Content-Security-Policy, and every browser hashes the script's text
# after normalising its line endings to LF (HTML standard, 13.2.3.1; the controller normalises too). Committing the pages
# with LF keeps a checkout's bytes and the hash in step whatever the platform.
certify-service/src/main/resources/static/offer/*.html text eol=lf
